Probe 2 — repository insert shape { ...doc, _id: 'pos-abc-123' }:
  new Position({ ...doc, _id: 'pos-abc-123' }).validateSync()
  -> _id CastError: "Cast to ObjectId failed for value \"pos-abc-123\" (type string) at path \"_id\" because of \"BSONError\""

Probe 3 — repository findById with opaque string id:
  Position.findById('pos-abc-123')
  -> CastError: "Cast to ObjectId failed for value \"pos-abc-123\" ... model \"Position\""

Probe 4 — migration apply determinism:
